WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.126
♪♪

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:04.755
I’m aware of the dangers out
there.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.091
And I know you’re scared.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:09.593
(Alien screeches)

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:11.053
But I can’t hide and wait

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:11.803
(Gun shots)

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:12.804
for the world to end.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.098
So this is it.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.434
(Gun shots)

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.435
Do we fight

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.104
or let go?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.231
(Explosion)

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:23.732
♪♪

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:27.986
We’re really in the thick of the
war

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.740
and the aliens have a
stronger foothold on Earth.

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:34.493
It’s a story about a collective,

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:37.663
surviving a moment of complete
chaos.

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:39.623
For months now we’ve been

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:43.460
outnumbered, outflanked,
outgunned.

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:47.214
There’s only one person who’s
ever made contact.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:49.758
 You.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.137
These aliens come at you even
harder. 

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:56.056
They tap into your weakness. 

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.351
They’ve managed to really get
into your head.

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:01.436
Are you sure you want to do
this?

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.730
(Breathing heavy)

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.731
(Alien chittering)

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:10.654
They have evolved. They are now
more vicious, more aggressive.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.030
Run. Now.

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.282
(Screams)

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:15.284
They are expanding.

00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:17.494
There’s still discovery, there’s
still questions. 

00:01:17.828 --> 00:01:19.997
What is going on and why it’s
happening.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.624
The answers are here.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:23.959
♪♪

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:28.338
It’s not only a story about
 an invasion of aliens,

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:31.133
it’s about
 the human connection.

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:32.551
This family is my whole world.

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:35.053
I will do anything and
everything to hold it together.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.472
And we’re all on a mission...

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:38.890
I just can’t see the pattern.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.977
...to understand how to save
humanity.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:43.353
♪♪

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.981
If Season 1 was the quiet before
the storm,

00:01:47.691 --> 00:01:48.692
Season 2 is the storm.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.068
♪♪

00:01:50.402 --> 00:01:51.236
Showtime.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:53.113
(Scream)

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.073
Sarah!

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:57.576
♪♪

